  "body": "QUALITY FAMILY HOME FOR RELOCATION\r\nA fantastic opportunity to secure a quality 4 bedroom, 2 bathroom home ready to relocate to your site.\r\nAt approximately 220m², this home offers a practical family-friendly layout with the added bonus of two bathrooms – a sought-after feature in a relocatable home of this size.\r\n\r\nNice warm tidy house, our builders can reclad the whole house into nice weatherboard if you want. Lets discuss.\r\nProperty Features:\r\n\r\n4 bedrooms\r\n2 bathrooms\r\nApprox. 220m²\r\nPractical family layout\r\nReady for relocation\r\n$345,000 incl. GST\r\n\r\nPrice includes:\r\nDelivery within approx 200km of Auckland and placement onto standard pile foundations.\r\nOur team can reeclad the plaster if you want weatherboard and also lay a concrete pad for the garage.\r\n\r\nForde Brothers can also assist with the relocation and consent process, with 4 experienced in-house architects and contacts for geotechnical and surveying requirements.\r\n\r\nHave land but unsure whether this house will work on your site?\r\nGet in touch with our team and we can discuss access, site requirements and the relocation process with you.\r\nCall Mike – 027 559 9386\r\nMike@fordebrothers.co.nz\r\nMore relocatable homes available – check out our other listings or visit the Forde Brothers website. https://fordebrothers.co.nz/properties/",
